      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just fundamentally misaligned with everything. like my entire way of being is just... a glitch. i try to patch the holes, i try to update how i act so i can interface with people better, but the core code is just broken. it feels like i was designed wrong from the start, and no amount of effort is ever gonna fix it. it just feels like a mistake that keeps going on and on.",
